ENVIRONMENT DIAGNOSIS
The audit sandbox unshares the PID namespace without mounting a matching /proc.
Python os.getpid() returned a numeric PID whose /proc/<pid>/exe entry did not exist.
Lean 4.22's lean_io_app_path uses exactly /proc/<getpid()>/exe. The kernel-provided
/proc/self/exe link remained valid. evidence/proc_self_exe_compat.c redirects only
that exact self-executable readlink and passes all other readlink calls through.

